<p>Thanks to the original author (daveyoufool), Eskobar, Agent Macleod, Petrograd and psul.</p>
<p>Note that this probably exists in a hard-ish sf version of the Foundation-verse without some of the more space operatic objects that aren't consistent with this (unless you want them to be!).</p>
